# The Talking Calculator (cavekit-flash.md R7): a sum keyed in shows its answer. No reference picture and no reading
# of digits: the display after "7 + 8 =" must be the display after "1 5" keyed directly, and must not be the display
# after Clear.
id: flash-app-calculator
section: Flash
item: A Flash app does its task, the calculator: 7 + 8 = shows what keying 15 shows (the display's picture equal), and not what Clear shows
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8097/title/cyberchase-calculator
kit: cavekit-flash.md R7
wait rect m 40
wait still m@550,550:165,99,397,155 20
stage-tap m 550 550 223 223
wait still m@550,550:165,99,397,155 6
sample cleared m@550,550:165,99,397,155
stage-tap m 550 550 193 344
pause 900
stage-tap m 550 550 251 303
wait still m@550,550:165,99,397,155 6
sample fifteen m@550,550:165,99,397,155
expect region-changed m@550,550:165,99,397,155 cleared
shoot keyed-15
stage-tap m 550 550 223 223
wait still m@550,550:165,99,397,155 6
expect region-equal m@550,550:165,99,397,155 cleared
stage-tap m 550 550 193 264
pause 900
stage-tap m 550 550 365 303
pause 900
stage-tap m 550 550 251 264
pause 900
stage-tap m 550 550 365 365
wait still m@550,550:165,99,397,155 6
expect region-equal m@550,550:165,99,397,155 fifteen
shoot sum
